That's a prestigious position.

76
00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:45.970
Yes.

77
00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:48.430
He did it from 2001 to 2004.

78
00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:52.090
He, of course, was a writer on The Office until 2008.

79
00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:58.030
He then went on to co-create Parks and Rec, Brooklyn Nine-Nine, and he created The Good

80
