Place and Rutherford Falls with our very own Ed HelMs.

81
00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:02.190
Wow.

82
00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:02.730
Yeah.

83
00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:07.450
His resume is full of other shows that he's also produced on and written for.

