907
00:49:45.760 --> 00:49:45.900
Yeah.

908
00:49:46.060 --> 00:49:46.160
Right.

909
00:49:46.260 --> 00:49:51.620
And so there could be years and years and years of stories and they are a surprise to

910
00:49:51.620 --> 00:49:52.920
the actor every week.

911
00:49:53.180 --> 00:49:53.620
Mm-hmm.

912
00:49:53.700 --> 00:49:58.260
And so with a movie, well, I can see the movie script.

